[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=chopin: keep the system out of suspend
Comment=Suspend cannot work on this port: the USB gadget (ttyGS0 console) refuses to suspend and a failed suspend leaves the display half torn down, which shows as a garbled panel. Hold a logind inhibitor so nothing can suspend the machine.
Exec=gnome-session-inhibit --inhibit suspend --reason "suspend is unsupported on chopin" sleep infinity
Icon=system-suspend
NoDisplay=true
X-GNOME-Autostart-enabled=true
